# UI kit: mandatory shared components

## Available components (from `@/components/ui-kit`)

| Component | Purpose | When to use |
|-----------|---------|-------------|
| `PageShell` | Page wrapper with title, subtitle, actions | Every route-level page |
| `FormField` | Label + error + help wrapper | Every form field |
| `DataTable` | TanStack table with sort, select, resize, virtual scroll, tree mode | Every data listing |
| `SearchToolbar` | Search input with 300ms debounce + optional filters/actions | Every searchable page |
| `ConfirmModal` | Delete/destructive confirmation dialog | Every delete action |
| `Modal` | Ant Design modal (re-exported from ui-kit) | Any dialog; use `footer` for actions |
| `Button` | Ant Design button (re-exported) | Actions, form triggers |
| `Input` | Ant Design input + `Input.TextArea` | Text fields |
| `Select` | Ant Design select | Dropdowns (prefer `SmartSelect` for searchable entity lists) |
| `SmartSelect` | Ant Select with client-side search, capped options | Entity pickers, dropdowns |
| `SmartMultiSelect` | Multi-select variant of SmartSelect | Multi-entity pickers |
| `TimezoneSelect` | Timezone picker (persisted to localStorage) | Report pages |
| `DateTimeRangePicker` | Date range with optional time | Report toolbars |
| `StatCard` | Metric card with title/value/trend | Dashboard |
| `EmptyState` | Empty state with icon + CTA button | Empty lists |
| `useToastApi` | Toast notifications via Ant message | Success/error feedback |

## Import pattern
```tsx
import {
  PageShell,
  SearchToolbar,
  DataTable,
  ConfirmModal,
  Modal,
  Button,
  Input,
  Select,
  useToastApi,
} from '@/components/ui-kit'
```

## Ant Design: import through ui-kit only

**Do not** import from `'antd'` in feature code (`pages/`, `components/forms/`, `components/funnel-builder/`, etc.) for primitives that are already re-exported from `@/components/ui-kit`.

- **Always import** `Modal`, `Button`, `Input`, `Select` (and future re-exports) from `@/components/ui-kit`.
- **Exception:** components with no ui-kit surface yet (e.g. `Tabs`, `Collapse`, `DatePicker`, `Checkbox`, `Switch`, `Tooltip`) may import from `'antd'` until a thin re-export exists in `src/components/ui-kit/`. When you touch such a file repeatedly, **add a re-export** in ui-kit (`export { X } from 'antd'`) and switch imports — prefer growing ui-kit over scattered `antd` imports.
- **Implementation files** inside `src/components/ui-kit/` may import from `'antd'` (they are the single integration boundary).

This keeps styling, theming, and future swaps consistent app-wide.

## Form modals: fixed footer, scrolling body

Global modal CSS (see `design-tokens.css`) already makes **`.ant-modal-body`** scroll. For long forms:

- Put **primary actions in `Modal`’s `footer` prop** (not at the bottom of the scrollable form) so Cancel / Save stay visible.
- Wire submit from the footer with **`htmlType="submit"`** + **`form={formId}`** on the button and **`id={formId}`** on the `<form>` (React `useId()` is fine). Do not duplicate Cancel inside the form body unless there is a strong UX reason.

## Page skeleton (every entity page must follow this)
```tsx
import { PageShell, DataTable, ConfirmModal, Button, useToastApi } from '@/components/ui-kit'

export function ThingsPage() {
  const toast = useToastApi()
  // ... hooks, state

  return (
    <PageShell title="Things" actions={<Button type="primary" onClick={handleCreate}>New Thing</Button>}>
      <SearchToolbar value={search} onChange={setSearch} />
      <DataTable
        data={filteredData}
        columns={columnDefs}
        // ... sorting, selection, pagination
      />
      <ThingEditForm open={sheetOpen} onOpenChange={setSheetOpen} ... />
      <ConfirmModal open={!!deleteTarget} onConfirm={handleDelete} ... />
    </PageShell>
  )
}
```

## DataTable rules

### Column definitions MUST be memoized
```tsx
// WRONG — new array every render, causes grid thrashing
const columnDefs = [nameColumn(), idColumn(), ...]

// RIGHT — stable reference
const columnDefs = useMemo(() => [
  selectionColumn(),
  nameColumn(),
  idColumn(),
  ...buildColumnsFromReport(columns),
], [columns])
```

### Action handlers in columns MUST use refs
```tsx
const handleEditRef = useRef(handleEdit)
handleEditRef.current = handleEdit

const columnDefs = useMemo(() => [
  editBtnColumn((row) => handleEditRef.current(row.id)),
], [])
```

### Table config persistence
```tsx
const TABLE_KEY = 'things'  // unique per page
const tableConfig = useTableConfigStore(selectTableConfig(TABLE_KEY))
```

## Column helpers (from `@/components/ui-kit/data-table`)

Use the provided factories instead of defining columns from scratch:
- `nameColumn()`, `idColumn()`, `selectionColumn()`
- `editBtnColumn(onEdit)`, `cloneBtnColumn(onClone)`, `deleteBtnColumn(onDelete)`
- `addFunnelBtnColumn(onAdd)`, `moveBtnColumn(onMove)`
- `buildColumnsFromReport(columns)` — for drilldown/report data
- Metric columns: `visitsColumn()`, `clicksColumn()`, `ctrColumn()`, `convColumn()`, `revenueColumn()`, `costColumn()`, `plColumn()`, `roiColumn()`

## Feedback pattern
```tsx
const toast = useToastApi()

// Success
toast.success('Campaign created')

// Error — always use getErrorMessage
import { getErrorMessage } from '@/lib/utils'
toast.error(getErrorMessage(err))
```

## Ant Design components not yet in ui-kit
If no re-export exists, you may import from `'antd'` temporarily (e.g. `Tabs`, `Collapse`, `Checkbox`, `Switch`, `Tooltip`, `Tag`, `Segmented`, `InputNumber`). Prefer adding `export { X } from 'antd'` under `ui-kit/` when the same primitive appears in more than one feature.

## Icons: lucide-react only
```tsx
import { Plus, Trash2, Pencil, Copy, Search } from 'lucide-react'
```

## Never
- Never build a custom table component — use `DataTable`.
- Never build a custom select with search — use `SmartSelect`.
- Never build a custom confirm dialog — use `ConfirmModal`.
- Never build a custom page wrapper — use `PageShell`.
- Never show success/error without `useToastApi()`.
- Never skip `useMemo` on column definitions.
- Never use `@ant-design/icons` — use `lucide-react`.
- Never create a new notification/toast system — the app uses `antd` `App.useApp().message` via `useToastApi`.
- Never import `Modal`, `Button`, `Input`, or `Select` from `'antd'` in feature code — use `@/components/ui-kit`.
- Never put the only copy of Save/Cancel at the end of a long scrollable form inside the modal body when `footer` can hold them — use a fixed footer + `form` / `formId` submit wiring.
